      "text": "### 1. Channel length (number of levels)"
    },
    {
      "id": "06-CHANNELS-AND-DISTRIBUTION.md#014",
      "path": [
        "06-CHANNELS-AND-DISTRIBUTION.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
