        "root_concepts": "[distribution channel]",
        "section": "marketing",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Channels and Distribution",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Covered above: direct (0) vs one/two/three-level. **Disintermediation** (removing\nlevels, e.g. DTC e-commerce) trades reach for control and margin;\n**reintermediation** is when new digital intermediaries (marketplaces, aggregators)\ninsert themselves."
    },
