      },
      "text": "### 2. Channel intensity (how many outlets)"
    },
    {
      "id": "06-CHANNELS-AND-DISTRIBUTION.md#016",
      "path": [
        "06-CHANNELS-AND-DISTRIBUTION.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:marketing:06-channels-and-distribution, git-history:marketing:06-channels-and-distribution]",
        "canonical_path": "marketing/06-CHANNELS-AND-DISTRIBUTION.md",
        "concepts": "[channel design, distribution, retail, omnichannel, channel conflict, place]",
        "current_path": "marketing/06-CHANNELS-AND-DISTRIBUTION.md",
        "id": "maxim:marketing:channels-and-distribution",
        "index_roles": "[guide]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "marketing",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[distribution channel]",
        "section": "marketing",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Channels and Distribution",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\n+-----------------------------------------------------------------+\n|                  DISTRIBUTION INTENSITY                         |\n|                                                                 |\n|  INTENSIVE        as many outlets as possible.                  |\n|                   For: convenience goods (gum, soda).           |\n|                   Goal: ubiquity. Low control.                  |\n|                                                                 |\n|  SELECTIVE        a chosen subset of qualified outlets.         |\n|                   For: shopping goods (appliances, apparel).    |\n|                   Balance of coverage + control.                |\n|                                                                 |\n|  EXCLUSIVE        one (or very few) outlet per area.            |\n|                   For: specialty/luxury goods, complex B2B.     |\n|                   Max control + brand protection. Low reach.    |\n+-----------------------------------------------------------------+\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "06-CHANNELS-AND-DISTRIBUTION.md#017",
